# Files generated by ./configure + make in this in-tree librdrand copy.
#
# Committed sources are configure.ac, configure, Makefile.in, config.h.in and the
# *.c/*.h. Everything below is produced by running configure/make and must not be
# committed. Rules are anchored (leading `/`) so they only match this directory
# and never the committed *.in templates (Makefile.in, config.h.in).
#
# Note: *.o and *.a build outputs (rdrand.o, main.o, librdrand.a) are already
# covered by the repo-root .gitignore.

/Makefile
/config.h
/config.status
/config.log

# built test executable (Makefile `test:` target)
/test
